        "alt": "Cook the wedges",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Roast the salmon",
      "blocks": [
        "Lay the fillets skin-side down on a lined baking tray. Sprinkle with curry powder, drizzle with oil and season. When the wedges are halfway through cooking, roast the fish on the top shelf for 10–15 minutes, until opaque in the middle.",
        "Wash hands and equipment after handling raw fish."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
